{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】11月12日now早晨新聞重點</p>\n<p>【促加強溝通】中美外長通話，王毅表示中方願同美方加強溝通合作，處理敏感問題。</p>\n<p>【科技股反彈】美股標普同納指收市升逾百分之一，英偉達股價反彈。</p>\n<p>【稱胞弟殺人】蔡天鳳碎屍案續審，鄺港傑作供稱胞弟鄺港智殺死蔡天鳳。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T23:26:02.408857+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:02:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T23:19:30.695235+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T23:19:30.695235+00:00","content_hash":"a3c191f0164edb97293a71207bf54966886be130c4b023346c212740ff83566b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}